      "id": "15edb724-af48-42d1-9d73-6ad28ac9780f",
      "slug": "macro-pmi-divergence-vol-mispricing",
      "category": "MACRO",
      "title": "PMI 分歧期的波动率错配：跨式与偏度的赔率结构",
      "summary": "价格分项与新订单背离，隐含波动率仍处低分位，本文拆解跨式与偏度结构的赔率差异。",
      "web_markdown": "---\ntitle: PMI 分歧期的波动率错配\ndate: 2026-10-12\ncategory: MACRO\ntags: [宏观, 波动率]\n---\n\n## 核心结论\n制造业价格分项持续走弱而新订单温和回升，波动率曲面因此呈现\"隐含下行、尾部偏度抬升\"的错配结构。",
      "wechat_html": "<p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#2c3e50;margin-bottom:16px;\">制造业价格分项持续走弱而新订单温和回升，波动率曲面因此呈现\"隐含下行、尾部偏度抬升\"的错配结构。</p><p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#94a3b8;\">【风控与合规声明】本文系莫伯个人宏观与量化交易体系的学术复盘笔记，首发于 MoBoCapital.com，不构成任何证券投资建议或收益承诺。市场有风险，决策需独立。</p>",
      "xueqiu_markdown": "结论先行：当价格分项与新订单背离，隐含波动率的错配往往先于方向兑现。$沪深300(SH000300)$ 的 30D IV 仍在低分位区间。",
      "x_thread_json": [
        "1/6  Vol is cheap, positioning is not. A divergence between PMI new orders and prices is the classic setup for a volatility mispricing.",
        "2/6  When implied vol sits in the bottom decile but skew keeps rising, smart money is paying for protection.",
        "3/6  The trade: own convexity, cap the tail. 1x2 ratio spreads over 45DTE.",
        "4/6  Risk: if the divergence closes through demand, the spread flattens fast. Size accordingly.",
        "5/6  Discipline: max 1.25% NAV per structure, no exceptions.",
        "6/6  Full framework and the invalidation criteria: https://mobocapital.com/memo/macro-pmi-divergence-vol-mispricing"
      ],
      "cover_oss_url": null,
      "tags": [
